    "visibleText": "DAIKI FUJITA\n\nWORK\n\nABOUT\n\nCONTACT\n\nSOUND ON\nSites for waking. Worlds for dreaming.\nSites for waking. Worlds for dreaming.\nWEB & INTERACTIVE DESIGNER — TOKYO\nWEB · MOTION\nINTERACTION · 3D · UI/UX\nSCROLL TO EXPLORE\nX ↗\n(01) ABOUT\n\nI DESIGN AND BUILD WEBSITES\nTHAT STAY WITH YOU LIKE\nA memory — WHERE WEB,\n3D, MOTION AND INTERACTION\nBECOME ONE EXPERIENCE.\n\nI work across the digital fields of web design, UI/UX, 3D, interaction, and motion, shaping experiences that harmonize functionality with creativity. Beyond mere visual expression, I strive to craft refined websites that leave a lasting impression on users’ senses and memory.\n\nWebデザイン、UI/UX、3D、インタラクション、モーションのデジタル領域を横断し、機能性と創造性を調和させた体験を設計しています。単なる視覚表現にとどまらず、使う人の感覚や記憶に深く残るような洗練されたウェブサイトを追求しています。\n\n(02) DISCIPLINES\n(01)\nWEB DESIGN\nSITES PEOPLE REMEMBER\n(02)\nUI / UX\nCLARITY YOU CAN FEEL\n(03)\n3D\nSPACE, LIGHT AND MATERIAL\n(04)\nINTERACTION\nTHINGS THAT ANSWER BACK\n(05)\nMOTION\nTIME AS A DESIGN TOOL\n(06)\nLOGO & GRAPHIC\nMARKS THAT HOLD A WORLD\n(03) SELECTED WORKS\n01 / 03\n01 — PORTFOLIO\nPORTFOLIO V2\nROLE\nWeb Design / 3D / Motion / Interaction / Game Design / Development\nYEAR\n2026\nOPEN THE MEMORY\n→\n02 — GALLERY SITE\nINCEPTURE\nROLE\nWeb Design / Logo Design / Graphic Design / 3D / Development\nYEAR\n2025\nOPEN THE MEMORY\n→\n03 — PORTFOLIO\nPORTFOLIO V1\nROLE\nWeb Design / Logo Design / Graphic Design / Development\nYEAR\n2025\nOPEN THE MEMORY\n→\n(04) DREAM MODE\n\nThere is another way\n\nto see this archive.\n\nENTER THE DREAM\n→\nTHREE PROJECTS ARE HELD BY THE DREAM — WIN THEM BACK\n(05) RECOGNITION\n\n14\n\n2026\nPortfolio v2\nThe FWA\nFWA of the Day\nCSS Winner\nSite of the Month\nCSS Winner\nSite of the Day\n2025\nINCEPTURE\nThe FWA\nFWA of the Day\nCSS Design Awards\nSpecial Kudos\nCSS Design Awards\nBest UI Design\nCSS Design Awards\nBest UX Design\nCSS Design Awards\nBest Innovation\nCSS Winner\nSite of the Day\nPortfolio v1\nCSS Design Awards\nSpecial Kudos\nCSS Design Awards\nBest UI Design\nCSS Design Awards\nBest UX Design\nCSS Design Awards\nBest Innovation\nCSS Winner\nSite of the Day\n(06) CONTACT\nSAY\nHELLO.\nSend an email ↗\nELSEWHERE\nX ↗\nSTILL AWAKE?\nENTER THE DREAM →\n© 2026 DAIKI FUJITA\nBACK TO TOP ↑\n090\n[ENTER]\n[ENTER]",
